### Tested versions\n\n4.4, 4.5\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.5.dev.mono  - EndeavourOS  SMP PREEMPT_DYNAMIC Sun, 23 Mar 2025 17:17:30 +0000 on Wayland - X11 display driver, Multi-window, 1 monitor - Vulkan (Mobile) - integrated AMD Radeon Graphics (RADV RENOIR) - AMD Ryzen 7 4800U with Radeon Graphics (16 threads)\n\n### Issue description\n\nThe [docs](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/tutorials/assets_pipeline/importing_images.html) say basis universal provides very small disk size, but actually its size is the same as vram compressed:  \n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/dea0377a-263b-4b8f-a7f9-90d3bca2910f)\n\n( the `test.png` is rgb8, `atest.png` is rgba8 )\n\nAlso, basis universal doesn't discard the unused alpha channel, which makes its size even 2x larger.\n\nThis also happens in PortableCompressedTexture.\n\nI also try using basisu command line tool to compress, the ktx2 images I get is much smaller [test_images.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/19601445/test_images.zip):\n```bash\nbasisu -uastc test.png\nbasisu -uastc atest.png\n```\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/757b62ad-d1c4-4727-bc01-1f4d357c13b8)\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nImport textures using basis universal compression.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[basis-import-test.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/19601172/basis-import-test.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105012/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105012/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}